        "created_at": "2015-10-14T20:49:25.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>For 1, the way I have played it is that they are not searchable, but you also don't need to forget what you know. So yes, experienced players have an advantage. Just don't pay attention to the deck when shuffling it.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
